<title>ITALY: Italian bonds/futures.</title>
<headline>Italian bonds/futures.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bond futures held to firmer level in late trading supported by higher level to other world bond markets and continued optimism over Italy joining a single European currency, dealers said.</p>
<p>They added that there was some caution as the 1997 budget passes through parliament and ahead of a Bundesbank meeting on Thursday but generally the mood remains positive.</p>
<p>&quot;The mood was optimistic today, but worries over the budget and negative comments from the Bundesbank over some Europe nation's fudging the figures to get into a single currency are concerning some,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
